# Medical AI Services API Keys
# IMPORTANT: The demo key 'helloworld' WILL NOT WORK for real prescriptions!

# Google Cloud Vision API (for OCR - text extraction from images)
# To get your key: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Enable: Cloud Vision API
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY_HERE

# OCR Space API (fallback OCR service) - FREE TIER AVAILABLE
# Get your FREE API key here: https://ocr.space/ocrapi
# 1. Click "Register for free API key"
# 2. Enter your email
# 3. Copy the key you receive (looks like: K12345678901234)
# 4. Replace the line below with: EXPO_PUBLIC_OCR_SPACE_API_KEY=your_actual_key
EXPO_PUBLIC_OCR_SPACE_API_KEY=K89061775188957

# ⚠️ CRITICAL: Replace 'helloworld' above with your real OCR.space key!
# Without a valid key, prescription scanning will fail!

